// EXPECTED: compile error — a bare local ARRAY passed to a [*]T slice param of a
// fire-and-forget spawn coerces to a slice aliasing the stack; the thread may
// outlive the frame (cross-thread use-after-free). arg-type TYPE_ARRAY was
// UNCASED in the spawn ptr-like gate, so the check never ran (only an unrelated
// emitter limitation masked it). TYPE_ARRAY now included.
void worker([*]u32 s) { s[0] = 9; }
void run() { u32[4] local; spawn worker(local); }
u32 main() { run(); return 0; }
